{"id":"desastre","lemma":"desastre","pos":"noun","rank":1031,"glosses":["disaster, catastrophe, calamity","disaster, a debacle, a bust","mess, shambles, wreckage"],"ipa":"/deˈsastɾe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"desastres"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desastre.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquello era un desastre.","en":"It was a disaster.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/690911","words":[{"g":"that one","l":"aquél"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Sé que es un desastre.","en":"I know it's a mess.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448613","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Eres tú el responsable de este desastre?","en":"Are you responsible for this mess?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"responsible"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"},null]},{"text":"¡Qué desastre!","en":"What a mess!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438534","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Los desastres naturales pueden ser devastadores.","en":"Natural disasters can be devastating.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"natural","l":"natural"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},null]}]}